<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in tonnes 66 Brix for the period May 26 to June 1 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		June 2-8     June 3-9	 TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    210,750.3   197,630.1</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  17,697.8     3,231.7   1,050,672.1    915,452.4</p>
<p> Home Market	  249.9	 166.8	15,652.5     17,673.0</p>
<p> Stocks/close   192,802.6   194,231.6</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
